        {
          "text": "Akudi anyana kaGadi mumakiŋu awu, mwahita yisaka yawu, mwahitamavumu awankakulula jawu, mwachindililuwu majinawu, kutachikila hadianyaka makumi ayedi nakubadikamu, ayilaŋa kunjita ejima; ",
