        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi akudi anyana kaIsarela ejima achindiluwu mwahita mavumu awankakulula jawu, kutachikila hadi anyaka makumi ayedi nakubadikamu, amuIsarela ayilaŋa kunjita ejima; ",
