          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aLevi wakayi kunjika kumudimu watabanaka yawunsahu, niwayuma yekalamu yejima niwayuma yayu yi kwawu yejima. Akasendaŋa tabanaka niyumayayu yejima; akayikalakalaŋa, akate ekaŋa kwitenti kwi-ndo.",
