              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila aLev i akate-ekaŋa kutabanaka yawunsahu kwi-ndo kulonda chipompelu chawanyana kaIsarela akabuli kuchizuwila; aLevi akatalaŋa mudimu watabanaka yawunsahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
